// A capture plan (`dev_capture::plan::CapturePlan`), the game's environment destruction (game
// state only): one shipped round fired square at the house wall nearest the map's centre, framed
// by the wall cue's own camera before and after. From the checkout root:
//
//   OVERMATCH_CAPTURE=scripts/capture/example.ron OVERMATCH_MUTE=1 target/debug/overmatch --offline
//
// writes target/capture/example-00009.0000s.png and target/capture/example-00012.0000s.png, then
// exits. Times and size are capture configuration (ASSUMED), not game data.
(
    frames: (
        out: "target/capture/example.png",
        at: [9.0, 12.0],
        size: (1280, 720),
        ui: false,
        gizmos: false,
    ),
    wall: (
        shots: [Round(round: "88mm_AP", at: 10.0)],
    ),
)
